Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tibble
Suggests:
    censobr,
    arrow,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
